title: Rear Camera 'Full View Not Available' Warning Overlay Removal
raw_community_title: Removes black box on reverse camera that says "full view not
  available
category: Cameras and ADAS
platform: F-150
model_years: 2021-2026
trim: All
validated: true
verified_by: Kyle / AsBuiltPro
source_sheet: 2021-2026 F150.xlsx
notes: 'If your current value is 0 then change to 1, 2 change to 3, 4 change to 5,
  6 change to 7  Note: reset APIM after the change'
post_procedure: Reset APIM in FORScan or cycle ignition.
steps:
- module: APIM
  address: 7D0-02-02
  mask: xxx* xxxx xx--
  notes: 'If your current value is 0 then change to 1, 2 change to 3, 4 change to
    5, 6 change to 7  Note: reset APIM after the change'
  nibble: 3
  community_instruction: 'If your current value is 0 then change to 1, 2 change to
    3, 4 change to 5, 6 change to 7  Note: reset APIM after the change'
  feature_name: RCOD HMI w/o Blackbox (RCODHMIB)
  target_state: RCODHMIB Disabled
  bit: 0
  action: 0
